    "text": "gorgenewscenter.com\nwebsite\nSalem\nBureau of Land Management issues temporary closure at Wildwood Recreation Site for habitat restoration work\nBy GNCadm1n,\n1 days agoSALEM, Ore. — The Bureau of Land Management will temporarily close the lower half of Wildwood Recreation Site on August 11 from 8:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. for habitat restoration work. The Old Mill Trail and upper group area of Wildwood Recreation Site will remain open, while the Wetland and Cascade Stream Watch trails will be unavailable.",
